					   |   |
					   |   |
					   |___|


The second one says:

 _________________________________________________
|                                                 |   
|            BEWARE THE DRY MUD!                  |
|                                                 | 
|   Although seemingly providing stable ground,   |
|  walking on it will cause it to break, leaving  |
|  you exposed to the bottomless pit underneath!  |
|                                                 |
